#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:282
msgid ""
"Files in the file formats marked as Save/Open can be opened or saved with "
"the <guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem>, and "
"<guimenuitem>Save As</guimenuitem> menu items in the "
"<guimenuitem>File</guimenuitem> menu. Files in the file formats marked as "
"Import/Export can be imported or exported with the items on the "
"<guimenuitem>Import Data</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Export Data "
"</guimenuitem> submenus of the <guimenuitem>Data</guimenuitem> menu."
msgstr ""
"Filer i format markerade som Spara/öppna kan öppnas eller sparas med "
"menyalternativen <guimenuitem>Öppna</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Spara</guimenuitem> och <guimenuitem>Spara som</guimenuitem> i "
"menyn <guimenuitem>Arkiv</guimenuitem>. Filer i format markerade som "
"Importera/exportera kan importeras eller exporteras med alternativen i "
"undermenyerna <guimenuitem>Importera data</guimenuitem> och "
"<guimenuitem>Exportera data </guimenuitem> i menyn "
"<guimenuitem>Data</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:299
msgid "<application>Gnumeric</application> XML File Format"
msgstr "<application>Gnumeric</application>-formatet XML"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:301
msgid ""
"The <application>Gnumeric</application> file format is based on the "
"eXtensible Markup Language (XML) and is used as the default file format."
msgstr ""
"Filformatet i <application>Gnumeric</application> bygger på Extensible "
"Markup Language (XML) och används som standardformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:307
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> is currently using two different systems"
" to process XML."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> använder för närvarande två olika system"
" för att hantera XML."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:312
msgid ""
"The newer system is based on the SAX processing method for XML and is "
"substantially faster than the older method. This code is based in a plugin "
"module. The exporter is currently used by default but the importer is still "
"incomplete."
msgstr ""
"Det nyare systemet bygger på XML-metoden SAX och är betydligt snabbare än "
"den äldre metoden. Koden finns i en insticksmodul. Exportören används som "
"standard, men importören är ännu inte färdig."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:319
msgid ""
"The older system is part of the core <application>Gnumeric</application> "
"program and is still used to open files in the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> format."
msgstr ""
"Den äldre metoden ingår i <application>Gnumeric</application> och används "
"fortfarande för att öppna filer i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-format."

